# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the CPU, memory, and GPU resources for a managed workflow, and define sizes that match the size of the problem."
msgstr "Pilih sumber CPU, memori dan GPU untuk aliran kerja terurus, dan tentukan saiz yang sepadan dengan saiz masalah."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a compute profile"
msgstr "Pilih profil pengkomputeran"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a compute profile {#choose-a-compute-profile}"
msgstr "Pilih profil pengkomputeran {#choose-a-compute-profile}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed workflows run on compute profiles. A compute profile is a fixed combination of vCPUs, memory, and GPUs, similar to the resources that you request from an HPC scheduler. When you upload a workflow, you map its sizes, such as `S` and `M`, to profiles, and each run picks one of those sizes. The job then runs on its own node with that profile, and keeps the profile until the job ends.\n"
msgstr "Aliran kerja terurus berjalan pada profil pengkomputeran. Profil pengkomputeran ialah gabungan tetap vCPU, memori dan GPU, serupa dengan sumber yang anda minta daripada penjadual HPC. Apabila anda memuat naik aliran kerja, anda memetakan saiznya, seperti `S` dan `M`, kepada profil, dan setiap larian memilih salah satu saiz itu. Job kemudian berjalan pada nodnya sendiri dengan profil tersebut, dan mengekalkan profil itu sehingga job tamat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Profile | vCPUs | Memory (GB) | GPUs |\n"
"| - | - | - | - |\n"
"| `8x32` | 8 | 32 | None |\n"
"| `16x128` | 16 | 128 | None |\n"
"| `48x768` | 48 | 768 | None |\n"
"| `128x1500` | 128 | 1500 | None |\n"
"| `24x120x1l40s` | 24 | 120 | 1 L40S |\n"
"| `20x320x2a100` | 20 | 320 | 2 A100 |\n"
"| `80x1200x8a100` | 80 | 1200 | 8 A100 |\n"
"| `160x1792x8h100` | 160 | 1792 | 8 H100 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Profil | vCPU | Memori (GB) | GPU |\n"
"| - | - | - | - |\n"
"| `8x32` | 8 | 32 | Tiada |\n"
"| `16x128` | 16 | 128 | Tiada |\n"
"| `48x768` | 48 | 768 | Tiada |\n"
"| `128x1500` | 128 | 1500 | Tiada |\n"
"| `24x120x1l40s` | 24 | 120 | 1 L40S |\n"
"| `20x320x2a100` | 20 | 320 | 2 A100 |\n"
"| `80x1200x8a100` | 80 | 1200 | 8 A100 |\n"
"| `160x1792x8h100` | 160 | 1792 | 8 H100 |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A profile ID has the form `{cpu}x{memory}`, with memory in GB, or `{cpu}x{memory}x{count}{gpu}` for a profile with GPUs. For example, `24x120x1l40s` has 24 vCPUs, 120 GB of memory, and one NVIDIA L40S GPU.\n"
msgstr "ID profil berbentuk `{cpu}x{memory}`, dengan memori dalam GB, atau `{cpu}x{memory}x{count}{gpu}` bagi profil yang mempunyai GPU. Contohnya, `24x120x1l40s` mempunyai 24 vCPU, 120 GB memori dan satu GPU NVIDIA L40S.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check available profiles {#check-available-profiles}"
msgstr "Semak profil yang tersedia {#check-available-profiles}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see which profiles are available, call `compute_profiles()`:\n"
msgstr "Untuk melihat profil yang tersedia, panggil `compute_profiles()`:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Look up a profile by its resources {#look-up-a-profile-by-its-resources}"
msgstr "Cari profil mengikut sumbernya {#look-up-a-profile-by-its-resources}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instead of typing a profile ID, you can describe the resources that your workflow needs with `compute_profile()`, and use the result as a value in `sizes_map`. Pass `cpu` and `memory` in GB, and pass `gpu` for a GPU profile:\n"
msgstr "Daripada menaip ID profil, anda boleh menerangkan sumber yang diperlukan oleh aliran kerja anda dengan `compute_profile()`, dan menggunakan hasilnya sebagai nilai dalam `sizes_map`. Hantar `cpu` dan `memory` dalam GB, dan hantar `gpu` bagi profil GPU:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A `sizes_map` accepts profile IDs and the profiles that `compute_profile()` returns, and you can mix both in one map. To check a profile ID before you upload, pass it to `compute_profile()`, for example `client.compute_profile(\"16x128\")`. If no profile matches, the error lists the available profiles.\n"
msgstr "`sizes_map` menerima ID profil dan profil yang dikembalikan oleh `compute_profile()`, dan anda boleh mencampurkan kedua-duanya dalam satu peta. Untuk menyemak ID profil sebelum anda memuat naik, hantarnya kepada `compute_profile()`, contohnya `client.compute_profile(\"16x128\")`. Jika tiada profil yang sepadan, ralat itu menyenaraikan profil yang tersedia.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`compute_profiles()` returns a list, so you can also filter it yourself. For example, the following code finds the GPU profiles:\n"
msgstr "`compute_profiles()` mengembalikan senarai, jadi anda juga boleh menapisnya sendiri. Contohnya, kod berikut mencari profil GPU:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set a default compute profile for your workflow {#set-a-default-compute-profile-for-your-workflow}"
msgstr "Tetapkan profil pengkomputeran lalai untuk aliran kerja anda {#set-a-default-compute-profile-for-your-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most workflows start with one size. Map it to a profile with `sizes_map`, and make it the default with `default_size`, when you upload the workflow:\n"
msgstr "Kebanyakan aliran kerja bermula dengan satu saiz. Petakan ia kepada profil dengan `sizes_map`, dan jadikannya lalai dengan `default_size`, apabila anda memuat naik aliran kerja:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every run of the workflow uses this profile, so you do not need to pass a size when you run it:\n"
msgstr "Setiap larian aliran kerja menggunakan profil ini, jadi anda tidak perlu menghantar saiz apabila anda menjalankannya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best practice: match sizes to problem sizes {#best-practice-match-sizes-to-problem-sizes}"
msgstr "Amalan terbaik: padankan saiz dengan saiz masalah {#best-practice-match-sizes-to-problem-sizes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A workflow solves specific problems, and it might require different compute profiles as the problems increase in scale and complexity. With a `sizes_map` for each workflow, you can do the following:\n"
msgstr "Aliran kerja menyelesaikan masalah tertentu, dan ia mungkin memerlukan profil pengkomputeran yang berbeza apabila skala dan kerumitan masalah bertambah. Dengan `sizes_map` bagi setiap aliran kerja, anda boleh melakukan perkara berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Give large problems enough compute resources to run to completion.\n"
msgstr "Berikan masalah besar sumber pengkomputeran yang mencukupi untuk berjalan sehingga selesai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prevent small problems from using a larger node than they need.\n"
msgstr "Elakkan masalah kecil menggunakan nod yang lebih besar daripada yang diperlukan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can base the sizes on the factors that determine your workflow's memory and CPU use, such as the subspace size, the number of batches, or the number of qubits.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh mendasarkan saiz pada faktor yang menentukan penggunaan memori dan CPU aliran kerja anda, seperti saiz subruang, bilangan batch, atau bilangan qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the sizes {#define-the-sizes}"
msgstr "Tentukan saiz {#define-the-sizes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can map up to four sizes, for small (`S`), medium (`M`), large (`L`), and extra-large (`XL`) problems. For example, the following code defines a workflow with three sizes:\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh memetakan sehingga empat saiz, untuk masalah kecil (`S`), sederhana (`M`), besar (`L`) dan sangat besar (`XL`). Contohnya, kod berikut mentakrifkan aliran kerja dengan tiga saiz:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Size rules {#size-rules}"
msgstr "Peraturan saiz {#size-rules}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Size labels must be `S`, `M`, `L`, or `XL`, so a workflow can define up to four sizes. A managed workflow matches labels in uppercase or lowercase, and stores them in uppercase. Two sizes can map to the same profile.\n"
msgstr "Label saiz mestilah `S`, `M`, `L` atau `XL`, jadi aliran kerja boleh mentakrifkan sehingga empat saiz. Aliran kerja terurus memadankan label dalam huruf besar atau huruf kecil, dan menyimpannya dalam huruf besar. Dua saiz boleh dipetakan kepada profil yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A workflow rejects the first upload in the following cases:\n"
msgstr "Aliran kerja menolak muat naik pertama dalam kes berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A label is not `S`, `M`, `L`, or `XL`.\n"
msgstr "Label bukan `S`, `M`, `L` atau `XL`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You set `sizes_map` without `default_size`, or `default_size` without `sizes_map`.\n"
msgstr "Anda menetapkan `sizes_map` tanpa `default_size`, atau `default_size` tanpa `sizes_map`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`default_size` is not one of the labels in `sizes_map`.\n"
msgstr "`default_size` bukan salah satu label dalam `sizes_map`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A value in `sizes_map` is not an available compute profile.\n"
msgstr "Nilai dalam `sizes_map` bukan profil pengkomputeran yang tersedia.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change sizes on re-upload {#change-sizes-on-re-upload}"
msgstr "Ubah saiz semasa muat naik semula {#change-sizes-on-re-upload}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you upload the workflow again with the same `title`, the managed workflow handles the sizes as follows:\n"
msgstr "Apabila anda memuat naik aliran kerja sekali lagi dengan `title` yang sama, aliran kerja terurus mengendalikan saiz seperti berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you set `sizes_map`, the new sizes replace all of the stored sizes.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda menetapkan `sizes_map`, saiz baharu menggantikan semua saiz yang tersimpan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you omit `sizes_map`, the workflow keeps the stored sizes and the default.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda tidak menyertakan `sizes_map`, aliran kerja mengekalkan saiz yang tersimpan dan lalai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To change only the default, set `default_size` without `sizes_map`. The value of `default_size` must be one of the stored sizes.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengubah lalai sahaja, tetapkan `default_size` tanpa `sizes_map`. Nilai `default_size` mestilah salah satu saiz yang tersimpan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set `default_size` every time that you set `sizes_map`. A re-upload does not require `default_size`. If the new sizes do not include the old default, the workflow has no default, and every run without `function_size` fails.\n"
msgstr "Tetapkan `default_size` setiap kali anda menetapkan `sizes_map`. Muat naik semula tidak memerlukan `default_size`. Jika saiz baharu tidak termasuk lalai lama, aliran kerja tidak mempunyai lalai, dan setiap larian tanpa `function_size` gagal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a size for each run {#choose-a-size-for-each-run}"
msgstr "Pilih saiz bagi setiap larian {#choose-a-size-for-each-run}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pass `function_size` to `run()` to choose one of the workflow's sizes for that job. If you omit it, the job uses the workflow's default size:\n"
msgstr "Hantar `function_size` kepada `run()` untuk memilih salah satu saiz aliran kerja bagi job itu. Jika anda tidak menyertakannya, job menggunakan saiz lalai aliran kerja:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`sizes()` and `get_default_size()` return the sizes that were stored when you loaded the workflow. To see sizes that changed after you loaded the workflow, load it again.\n"
msgstr "`sizes()` dan `get_default_size()` mengembalikan saiz yang disimpan semasa anda memuatkan aliran kerja. Untuk melihat saiz yang berubah selepas anda memuatkan aliran kerja, muatkannya sekali lagi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To read the size and compute profile of the job, call `get_function_size()` and `get_compute_profile()` in your workflow code:\n"
msgstr "Untuk membaca saiz dan profil pengkomputeran job, panggil `get_function_size()` dan `get_compute_profile()` dalam kod aliran kerja anda:\n"

