#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"
msgstr "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshoot sizes {#troubleshoot-sizes}"
msgstr "Selesaikan masalah saiz {#troubleshoot-sizes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Problem | Cause |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| The upload fails with `Invalid size '...'. Valid sizes are: S, M, L, XL.` | A label in `sizes_map` is not one of the four supported labels. |\n"
"| The upload fails with `Unknown compute profile '...' for size '...'.` | A value in `sizes_map` is not an available profile. Check the ID with `compute_profiles()`, or use `compute_profile()` to look it up. |\n"
"| `compute_profile()` fails with `No compute profile matches ...` | No profile has exactly those resources. For a GPU profile, also pass `gpu`. Pick a profile from the list in the error. |\n"
"| The upload fails with `'default_size' is required when 'sizes' is provided.` | The first upload sets `sizes_map` without `default_size`. |\n"
"| `run()` fails with `Unknown function size '...' for this function. Available sizes: ...` | The workflow does not define the size that you passed to `function_size`. |\n"
"| `run()` fails with `This function has no size.` | A re-upload replaced the sizes and removed the default. Upload again with `default_size`, or pass `function_size`. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Masalah | Punca |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| Muat naik gagal dengan `Invalid size '...'. Valid sizes are: S, M, L, XL.` | Label dalam `sizes_map` bukan salah satu daripada empat label yang disokong. |\n"
"| Muat naik gagal dengan `Unknown compute profile '...' for size '...'.` | Nilai dalam `sizes_map` bukan profil yang tersedia. Semak ID dengan `compute_profiles()`, atau gunakan `compute_profile()` untuk mencarinya. |\n"
"| `compute_profile()` gagal dengan `No compute profile matches ...` | Tiada profil yang mempunyai sumber tepat seperti itu. Bagi profil GPU, hantar juga `gpu`. Pilih profil daripada senarai dalam ralat. |\n"
"| Muat naik gagal dengan `'default_size' is required when 'sizes' is provided.` | Muat naik pertama menetapkan `sizes_map` tanpa `default_size`. |\n"
"| `run()` gagal dengan `Unknown function size '...' for this function. Available sizes: ...` | Aliran kerja tidak mentakrifkan saiz yang anda hantar kepada `function_size`. |\n"
"| `run()` gagal dengan `This function has no size.` | Muat naik semula menggantikan saiz dan membuang lalai. Muat naik semula dengan `default_size`, atau hantar `function_size`. |\n"
